        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Kazan zion tumei ram gai tei,",
            "Ning na phang e ting mik kathui ;",
            "Khou tei lung khang jailou o,",
            "Mban thai pui ram khou.",
            "",
            "He! Ai ning e kallou mei pu,",
            "Lily pong guang immanual;",
            "Nthan mei dui tei luang e,",
            "Ai rui hei tei ning thuk e.",
            "",
            "2. Pap le nthiam pui ri rui dai e,",
            "Ning e pap ri ta adou khang ;",
            "He! Kao bumang samkei yo,",
            "Aniu ta kanlou khang .",
            "",
            "3. Lung gei mei rui ban thai khang makge,",
            "Hei kandi rianra ram khou hei;",
            "Mpat lou na tatni e,",
            "Kao kanaan ram gai khou.",
            "",
            "4. Kalvary siengding thing rukhou tei,",
            "Khaeng lou the aniu guang jisu;",
            "Ai rui hei tei mu lak khe;",
            "Halleluijah Amen."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
